  "description": "The Nukeproof Giga Carbon is the ultimate super-enduro machine , built for riders who demand more — more travel, more capability, and more confidence on the roughest trails. While efficient enough to climb, its true purpose is dominating descents with uncompromising aggression. Blending the DNA of our downhill Dissent and enduro Mega platforms, the Giga is our long-travel powerhouse engineered for speed, precision, and pure fun. Whether you’re chasing podiums, smashing technical descents, or sending it big at the bike park, the Giga delivers.",
